## 4. UI Feature Gating Example

Below is an example of evaluating feature flags dynamically in UI views.

<Tabs>
  <TabItem label="Android (Compose)">

```kotlin
// File: feature/user/ui/UserProfileHeader.kt
@Composable
fun UserProfileHeader(
    featureFlagManager: FeatureFlagManager = hiltViewModel()
) {
    val isNewUiEnabled = featureFlagManager.isFeatureEnabled(FeatureKey.NEW_USER_PROFILE_UI)

    if (isNewUiEnabled) {
        NewRedesignedProfileHeader()
    } else {
        LegacyProfileHeader()
    }
}
